{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S.E.M.I.</strong> is a cooperative online game about escaping from a special clinic. Here <strong>you and up to 3</strong> of your <span class=\"bb_strike\">feeble-minded</span> loyal friends in the role of patients fight with the staff and other patients and find yourself in unexpected situations. <span class=\"bb_strike\">Crooked hands</span>\u00a0Teamwork, random events, and taking experimental drugs that give unpredictable abilities play an important role. Combine them in various <strong>ways to get free</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate in voice chat and <span class=\"bb_strike\">arrange sabotage</span>\u00a0help your friends pass through rooms, get out of traps and fight with opponents! In your arsenal: close combat, physics, amazing abilities and ... imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take pills and get <strong>abilities</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bipolar force</strong> is an invulnerable monster, then a helpless rag!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser astigmatism</strong> \u2014 two sights, one laser\u2026 Where will he shoot?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stendhal syndrome</strong> \u2014 are you looking at a painting? Now you're hysterical and destroying everything around you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice's syndrome</strong> is either tiny or gigantic \u2014 have time to adjust!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madness is near! You and your friends can go crazy and start running, jumping and fighting, and your abilities will become uncontrollable. Do you want to take back control? <strong>Take the pills :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are randomly generated from rooms with changing gravity, traps, moving walls, and other &quot;pleasant&quot; surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a successful escape, you will receive a medical report: &quot;<i>The patient was stable until he started hitting the guards with a bottle. Diagnosis: Overmotivation</i>&quot; or something <strong>worse</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new costumes and decorations. Let each new escape be more stylish than the previous one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you and your friends be able to escape... or at least not go crazy?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the mental hospital! Here, your abilities are a lottery, and your friends can be the most dangerous opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957560?t=1758055781","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957560?t=1758055781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/c8aef2aef9768bf7238d9a7861c463defa3fba74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758055781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/c8aef2aef9768bf7238d9a7861c463defa3fba74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758055781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S.E.M.I.</strong> is a cooperative online game about escaping from a special clinic. Here <strong>you and up to 3</strong> of your <span class=\"bb_strike\">feeble-minded</span> loyal friends in the role of patients fight with the staff and other patients and find yourself in unexpected situations. <span class=\"bb_strike\">Crooked hands</span>\u00a0Teamwork, random events, and taking experimental drugs that give unpredictable abilities play an important role. Combine them in various <strong>ways to get free</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate in voice chat and <span class=\"bb_strike\">arrange sabotage</span>\u00a0help your friends pass through rooms, get out of traps and fight with opponents! In your arsenal: close combat, physics, amazing abilities and ... imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take pills and get <strong>abilities</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bipolar force</strong> is an invulnerable monster, then a helpless rag!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser astigmatism</strong> \u2014 two sights, one laser\u2026 Where will he shoot?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stendhal syndrome</strong> \u2014 are you looking at a painting? Now you're hysterical and destroying everything around you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice's syndrome</strong> is either tiny or gigantic \u2014 have time to adjust!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madness is near! You and your friends can go crazy and start running, jumping and fighting, and your abilities will become uncontrollable. Do you want to take back control? <strong>Take the pills :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are randomly generated from rooms with changing gravity, traps, moving walls, and other &quot;pleasant&quot; surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a successful escape, you will receive a medical report: &quot;<i>The patient was stable until he started hitting the guards with a bottle. Diagnosis: Overmotivation</i>&quot; or something <strong>worse</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new costumes and decorations. Let each new escape be more stylish than the previous one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you and your friends be able to escape... or at least not go crazy?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the mental hospital! Here, your abilities are a lottery, and your friends can be the most dangerous opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.poster.avif?t=1758055781\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.webm?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.mp4?t=1758055781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Two Horn Unicorn"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/51ca5044f7ca66e54c646bcafe7f2c01f3649fbf/header.jpg?t=1758055781","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"S.E.M.I. \u2013 Side Effects May Include...","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 series or Ryzen series<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960 or AMD R9 290<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 series or Ryzen series<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660 or RX6600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Two Horn Unicorn"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Nudez\nViol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required